  "vibe": "Arctic #0e1b2e night under three aurora bands — nine-point sine curtains filled at 8–12% and re-stroked bright, band two violet #8f7ae0, the others green #57e6a8 — rippling above a fixed black mountain ridge while twenty stars twinkle on their own phases. Sora over Atkinson Hyperlegible. The hook pushes its title down to 900px so the sky owns two thirds of the frame, and the camera drifts vertically at the calmest ambient rate in its family. Cards are glowing dark panels, montage tiles halo violet and the stat numerals themselves glow. Mechanics: a circular ring gauge, a ticker, a terminal and side alerts. Best for dark-mode products, developer tools, observability, astronomy and cold-weather travel.",
